{"overview":"داستان آن پنج سال پس از پایان ماجرای قسمت اول شروع می‌شود. هیکاپ حالا در سنین نوجوانی است، بسیاری از وایکینگ‌ها با اژدهاها دوست شده‌اند و با آن‌ها سواری می‌کنند. در همین بین هیکاپ متوجه می‌شود که این دوستی و آشتی دوام ندارد...","tagline":"","overview_en":"Five years after uniting the dragons and Vikings of Berk, Hiccup and Toothless soar beyond their homeland, charting the vast unknown. During one of their adventures, the pair discover a secret cave that houses hundreds of wild dragons—and a mysterious dragon rider with a startling connection to Hiccup. And as the ruthless conqueror Drago Bludvist rises to seize control of both dragons and people alike, Hiccup must step into his role as a true leader and, alongside his friends and Toothless, protect Berk from a devastating war.","tagline_en":"Training is over. The adventure begins.","runtime":102,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Dean DeBlois"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Jay Baruchel","role":"Hiccup (voice)","photo":"/1GYJeQzPcY9Pfmc3FFsBwClkCv7.jpg"},{"name":"کیت بلانشت","role":"Valka (voice)","photo":"/vUuEHiAR0eD3XEJhg2DWIjymUAA.jpg","en":"Cate Blanchett"},{"name":"جرارد باتلر","role":"Stoick (voice)","photo":"/i54XoxYieuff2w6MwyfwVUBvmR0.jpg","en":"Gerard Butler"},{"name":"Craig Ferguson","role":"Gobber (voice)","photo":"/mBxNrOxdQeM7bVBveE47Syj9ES6.jpg"},{"name":"America Ferrera","role":"Astrid (voice)","photo":"/7q9uUWnaIjveX8DTU2lcA7mA3dp.jpg"},{"name":"جونا هیل","role":"Snotlout (voice)","photo":"/cymlWttB83MsAGR2EkTgANtjeRH.jpg","en":"Jonah Hill"},{"name":"کریستوفر مینتس-پلس","role":"Fishlegs (voice)","photo":"/dnj2qyxmPt5JF5uurbXQLegppAx.jpg","en":"Christopher Mintz-Plasse"},{"name":"تی جی میلر","role":"Tuffnut (voice)","photo":"/rRrVvBxOkyYM5XdLXimShHR1Itn.jpg","en":"T.J. Miller"},{"name":"کریستن ویگ","role":"Ruffnut (voice)","photo":"/gEKYhc3HvNxWhxneVfeePu0rTm.jpg","en":"Kristen Wiig"},{"name":"جایمن هانسو","role":"Drago (voice)","photo":"/tpvtx